    content:
      fontFamily: Calibri
      fontSize: 12
      color: '#0D9488'
      align:
        - left
        - top
      wrap: true
      text: <p><span style="color:#0D9488;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">★ 主要交付</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    r — 最终漫反射图, 推理主结果, 用于后续相位解算等下游任务</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#F59E0B;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">◆ 调试 / 可视化</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    b — 镜面反射分量, 用于分析“去除了哪些高亮”</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    g — 网络对结构突变的预测, 反映边界关注度</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    s — 网络对高光位置的软定位, 反映高光检测准确性</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#7C3AED;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">◇ 训练辅助 (不直接保存)</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    r_direct — 主解码器直接预测路径, 训练时参与损失, 推理时参与双路融合</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    alpha    — 双路融合系数, 反映网络对两路的信任度</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    cs       — 跨尺度一致性标量, 仅作损失项, 不保存图像</span></p>
    sourceLayout: 531b8338674f1e80f02b185a690cb1083d6ca5c61ca83477d48193207dffb433
